   "textLength": 591,
   "text": "Australians are making extra contributions into their superannuation account, with one major fund seeing a surprise pattern of behaviour among its members recently. Workers, it seems, are increasingly feathering their nest egg as investors face higher taxes outside their mandated retirement fund.\nAdditional contributions among members nearly doubled in the wake of tax changes handed down in the bu",
