   ],
   "textLength": 309,
   "text": "June is typically a big month for extra contributions just in time for the end of the financial year tax deduction with July being pretty quiet on that front. But the fund saw a big amount of extra contributions in July 2026 – one of its biggest non-June months in years – which continued into August.\nRELATED",
