   "textLength": 604,
   "text": "Brisbane-based teacher Aaron Klarwein, 47, has been making extra contributions for years, by consistently salary sacrificing $50 a fortnight into his super account.\nIt means he expects to be able to retire in his 50s and rely on assets outside super until he hits the withdrawal age.\n\"So to have enough to get us through to when we can access super … and hopefully that doesn't change before that tim",
